msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

msgid "App Grid"
msgstr "应用网格"

msgid "Use the system wallpaper"
msgstr "使用系统默认壁纸"

msgid "The app grid uses the system's native workspace card wallpaper instead of this extension's screen-aligned sharp wallpaper. When disabled, the strip at the top of the app grid also shows the sharp wallpaper; the window picker and the rest of the overview always use it."
msgstr "应用网格页面使用系统原生的卡片壁纸，而不是本扩展的屏幕对齐清晰壁纸。关闭后，应用网格顶部的窄条也会显示清晰壁纸；窗口选择器和概览的其他部分始终使用清晰壁纸。"
